QuestGuidance.Register("en",191,{
[6081]="7002604E\n1\tHarvest pipe-weed (total: 8)\030Drive off crows (total: 6)\tThe pipe-weed and crows can be found around the fields of the Northcotton Farm. Blossom Gamgee asked you to pick some pipe-weed and drive off the crows that are stealing it.\n2\tBring the pipe-weed to Blossom Gamgee\tBlossom Gamgee is at the Pipe-weed House on the Northcotton Farm. Blossom Gamgee will want to see the pipe-weed you picked.\n",
[6082]="700400B2\n1\tBurn corsair tents (total: 4)\tThe tents are at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to venture to the corsair camp and burn down several tents.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be pleased to hear the tents have been burned.\n",
[6083]="700400D3\n1\tBurn Corsair tents (total: 4)\tThe tents are at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to venture to the Corsair camp and burn down several tents.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be pleased to hear the tents have been burned.\n",
[6084]="700400B1\n1\tDefeat corsair captains (total: 3)\tThe corsair captains are at the Hashadîr camp to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to venture to the corsair camp and eliminate the captains there.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be pleased to hear the captains have been eliminated.\n",
[6085]="700400D0\n1\tDefeat Corsair captains (total: 3)\tThe Corsair captains are at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to venture to the Corsair camp and eliminate the captains there.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be pleased to hear the captains have been eliminated.\n",
[6086]="700400B3\n1\tDefeat corsair slavers (total: 6)\tThe corsair slavers are at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to eliminate the slavers working out of the camp to the south.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be very pleased to hear the slavers have been eliminated.\n",
[6087]="700400D2\n1\tDefeat Corsair slavers (total: 6)\tThe Corsair slavers are at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to eliminate the slavers working out of the camp to the south.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be very pleased to hear the slavers have been eliminated.\n",
[6088]="700400CE\n1\tTrap the beach (total: 4)\tThe beach is at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolían asked you to place several traps along the beach to damage the corsair boats.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be pleased to the beach has been trapped.\n",
[6089]="700400D4\n1\tTrap the beach (total: 4)\tThe beach is at Hashadîr, to the south of Dol Amroth. Tolrían asked you to place several traps along the beach to damage the Corsair boats.\n2\tSpeak to Tolrían\tTolrían can be found in Dol Amroth. Tolrían will be pleased to the beach has been trapped.\n",
[6090]="7004137B\n1\tTalk to Langhár and travel with her to confront Ofolmóth\tLanghár is at Ost Guruth, the ruin-hold in the Lone-lands. Langhár has asked you to help her confront Ofolmóth, a Beorning who has turned to evil.\n2\tTalk to Langhár in Ost Guruth\tLanghár is at Ost Guruth, the ruin-hold in the Lone-lands. You have defeated Ofolmóth and ended his danger to the Free People of Eriador, but not without consequence.\n",
[6091]="70000CEE\n1\tInvestigate a ghost in Bree\tThe ruins the Mayor spoke of are in an alley not far from the South-gate, off to the right. Mayor Tenderlarch has asked you to investigate the rumours of a haunted alley and put the concerns of the Bree constables to rest. He has asked you to visit the alley by night, as that is the only time the ghost has been reported.\n2\tUse Black Rock\tThe ring is hidden at a barracks gate, but there are no barracks in Bree. The shade also mentioned a black rock, however. Perhaps if you locate this lost ring the shade spoke of, it can rest.\n3\tTalk to Lost Shade\030Collect The Shield-brother's Ring\tThe shade's alley is near the South-gate, in some old ruins. You should take the ring you found to the shade and see if that appeases it. The shade likely will only appear in the alley at night.\n",
[6092]="700075B6\n1\tDiscover the source of the Forest's unrest\tThe spider nest lies near the Willow Glade, to the south of Gillemin's old camp. Search there for signs of the angered tree. Gillemin told you that the source of the forest's unrest likely lay within the spider hollow beyond the Withywindle River to the south, within the Old Forest.\n2\tTalk to Toly Brockhouse\tReturn to Toly Brockhouse near the Gate that borders the Old Forest and Buckland. The dead tree has been slain, and though there is still great evil stirring within the wood, the borders of Buckland should see some manner of ease. You should return to Gillemin Brandybuck with the news.\n",
[6093]="7000329A\n1\tDefeat Mound-wight (total: 5)\030Defeat Mound-wight Archer\tThe wights inhabit the mounds of Emyn Hoedh, east of the Grimwater. Glamír has asked you to do battle against the mound-wights of Haudh Lin, while he searches for a way to rid the land of their presence.\n2\tTalk to Glamír\tGlamír is near the Grimwater, west of Emyn Hoedh and north-east of Gondamon. You should speak with Glamír and discover if he has found a way to defeat the wights once and for all.\n",
[6094]="7003A5C2\n1\tFind the Orc-cave in the White Mountains\tThe lair of the Rashat-hai can be found atop Dunharrow along the White Mountains. Ellen Fremedon has asked that you find and explore the lair of the Orcs that terrorize the people of Underharrow.\n2\tPatrol Gurz-shâpol\tGurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains. You have found the Orc-cave, and should now explore it.\n3\tPatrol deeper into Gurz-shâpol\tGurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains. You have encountered the Orcs, but you know there is more to be found in the depths of this cave.\n4\tPatrol deeper into Gurz-shâpol\tGurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains. You have discovered the Orcs and heard Rohirrim nearby. You should continue exploring the cave.\n5\tPatrol deeper into Gurz-shâpol\tGurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains. You have made it deep into the Orc cave, but have seen no sign of the Orc-leader. You should continue your search.\n6\tFind the leader of the Rashat-hai\tGurz-shâpol can be found atop the northern border of Dunharrow within the White Mountains. You have encountered many Orcs, captive Rohirrim, and even athelas, but you have yet to find the Rashat-hai leader. You should continue your search.\n7\tComplete Quest: Master of the Dead-Folk\tThe leader of the Rashat-hai can be found in the deepest reaches of Gurz-shâpol. You have found the Orc-leader and should now defeat him for the good of the people of Underharrow.\n8\tTalk to Ellen Fremedon\tEllen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow. You have purged the cave of the Rashat-hai and saved the people of Rohan from their vile plans. You should return to Ellen with these tidings.\n",
[6095]="700400EA\n1\tDefeat the Dead at the Stone of Erech\tThe Dead can be found around the Stone of Erech at night. You have encountered numerous Dead around the Stone of Erech and should defeat them in the hope they return to the Paths of the Dead.\n2\tDefeat the Dead at the Stone of Erech (total: 8)\tThe Dead can be found around the Stone of Erech at night. You have encountered numerous Dead around the Stone of Erech and should defeat them in the hope they return to the Paths of the Dead.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have laid many of the Dead to rest, albeit temporarily.\n",
[6096]="70041174\n1\tDefeat Corsairs in Tarlang's Crown (total: 8)\tCorsairs can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown. You have encountered numerous Corsairs and should defeat them before their numbers can grow even greater.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Corsairs in Tarlang's Crown.\n",
[6097]="7006D1AB\n1\tDestroy powder barrels (total: 6)\030Defeat Ordâkhai (total: 12)\tSearch Eshadûr for explosive black powder, and destroy any containers of the substance you find.\n",
[6098]="70028F04\n1\tCollect stalks of hay (total: 6)\tHay can be found to the east of Avardin. Levelha has asked you to collect hay for the horses.\n2\tBring the hay to Levelha in Avardin\tLevelha is in Avardin, in the central Starkmoor. Levelha will be pleased to see you have brought the hay back.\n",
[6099]="700303C4\n1\tCollect frogs in the Haycliff (total: 2)\tFrogs can be found within the Haycliff. Dernstad asked you to venture within the Haycliff and return with several frogs.\n2\tTalk to Dernstan\tDernstan is at Eaworth. Dernstan will be happy to start scraping the slime off of the frogs you gathered.\n",
[6100]="7002F309\n1\tDefeat Wood-trolls in the Haycliff (total: 6)\tWood-trolls can be found at the Haycliff. Dernstan has asked to venture within the Haycliff and defeat the Wood-trolls found there.\n2\tTalk to Dernstan\tDernstan is at Eaworth. Dernstan will be pleased to hear you have defeated many Wood-trolls within the Haycliff.\n",
[6101]="70026F0A\n1\tTalk to Luarch at the hunters' camp\030Collect turtle-shells (total: 8)\tTurtles can be found throughout the southern Dunbog. Luarch has asked you to hunt turtles in the area and collect their shells.\n",
[6102]="7000EC05\n1\tDefeat Nadelek\tNadelek dwells somewhere within Barad Gaurhoth. Vämmä has asked you to seek out the Gauradan war-leader, Nadelek, and defeat him.\n2\tTalk to Vämmä\tWith Nadelek defeated, you should return to Vämmä in Sûri-kylä and tell him of your victory.\n",
[6103]="700466D1\n1\tTalk to Éomer\tYou should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n2\tTalk to Éomer\tYou should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n",
[6104]="7007163B\n1\tWhistle at Líshu\tNahíd's sheep have returned, but need to be herded into their pen. You should whistle at Líshu to let her know it is time to work.\n2\tPoint out sheep for Líshu to herd (total: 5)\tLíshu is ready to herd the sheep into their pen. You should point at the sheep near the pen to instruct Líshu to herd them. If Líshu is missing, you can use Líshu's Horn, on the fence near Nahíd, to recall her.\n3\tTalk to Líshu\tThe sheep have all been returned to their pen. You should let Líshu know she has done a good job! If Líshu is missing, you can use Líshu's Horn, on the fence near Nahíd, to recall her.\n4\tTalk to Nahíd\tLíshu's job is finished. You should talk to Nahíd.\n",
[6105]="70047B9F\n1\tTravel to Haerondir\tTravel to Haerondir in the Noman-lands, north of the Camp of the Host.\n2\tTalk to Anborn\tAnborn can be found at Haerondir in the Noman-lands. You should talk to Anborn.\n",
[6106]="700272BF\n1\tDefeat Uch-lûth at Rhuvel-cadlus (total: 10)\tUch-lûth can be found at Rhuvel-cadlus, in the valley below Cuthric's post. Cuthric asked you to defeat Ox-clan warriors to dissuade them from warring upon Rohan.\n2\tTalk to Cuthric\tCuthric is hiding on the ridge above Rhuvel-cadlus. You should return to Cuthric with news of your victory.\n",
[6107]="70007678\n1\tDefeat fell spirits in the Great Barrow (total: 15)\tOthrongroth, the Great Barrow, is up the hill from the small encampment in the southern Barrow-downs. The fell spirits can be found within Othrongroth behind a door displaying a skull. As one last favour before leaving Middle-earth, Aradia and her companions would like to help cleanse the Shadow of Angmar from the Barrow-downs. She has asked you to enter Othrongroth and send the fell spirits which dwell there back to their master.\n2\tTalk to Aradia outside the Great Barrow\tAradia is camped outside the Great Barrow. You should return to Aradia with news of your success against the fell spirits of the Great Barrow.\n",
[6108]="70068240\n1\tTalk to Ziriha, the merchant\tHeshra has asked you to procure large quantities of ingredients he needs from Ziriha, the merchant. She can be found near the fishing pier.\n2\tGive dried ingredients to Heshra, the herbalist\tGive dried ingredients to Heshra in the Elder Hall.\n3\tAdminister salve to afflicted Khûtra villagers. They can be found on the rocks just outside of Khûtra, to the east.\t\n4\tReturn to Heshra, the herbalist\tReturn to Heshra the herbalist in the Elder Hall.\n",
[6109]="70068241\n1\tElder Ilaya has asked that you administer the improved salve to the afflicted goats and pigs in Khûtra. The goats can be found outside the Elder Hall.\t\n2\tAdminister salve to sullen diseased pig\030Administer salve to boisterous diseased pig\030Administer salve to despondent diseased pig\030Administer salve to glum diseased pig\030Administer salve to scheming diseased pig\030Administer salve to happy diseased pig\tYou should administer the salve to diseased pigs in Khûtra. They can be found in a pen outside the Elder Hall.\n3\tSpeak with Elder Ilaya\tReturn to Elder Ilaya outside the Elder Hall.\n",
[6110]="70068242\n1\tSpeak with Umaris, the fisher\tSpeak with Umaris, the fisher. She can be found by the fishing pier.\n2\tRelease the salve into fishing spots around Khûtra ([see journal]/5)\tUmaris has asked you to distribute the salve to the five best fishing spots in Khûtra. These fishing spots start on the fishing pier and then move west along the shore.\n3\tReturn to Umaris\tReturn to Umaris by the fishing pier.\n",
[6111]="7000757B\n1\tCollect a crate of oily salve from Hodric Bracegirdle\tHodric Bracegirdle lives on the forest side of Brandy Hall in Buckland. The hobbit Hoderic Bracegirdle supplies Stoutthrush with the healing salve he sells to Leecher Cartwell.\n2\tBring the crate of salve to Bruner Stoutthrush\tBruner Stoutthrush does business at the Combe-gate in Bree. Hodric, not entirely happily, gave you the crate Bruner requested. You should bring it to Stoutthrush straight away.\n",
[6112]="7005B002\n1\tPoisoned warriors can be found at Amdân. Thorin has tasked you with administering an antidote to the poisoned warriors resting at Amdân.\t\n2\tTalk to Thorin at Amdân\tThorin can be found at Amdân. You have delivered the antidote to the poisoned warriors at Amdân. You should return to Thorin.\n",
})
